# The build parses content/*.md by splitting on LF, and a CRLF checkout renders
# S01 empty from a build that exits clean. scripts/build.mjs normalises on read,
# which is the load-bearing fix; this file keeps the working tree honest so the
# failure cannot reappear through some other reader. See phd-lab#42.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff2 binary
